{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42251","headline":"又和太常萧少卿近郊马上偶吟 · 徐铉","name":"又和太常萧少卿近郊马上偶吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"抱瓮何人灌药畦，金衔爲尔驻平堤。\n村桥野店景无限，绿水晴天思欲迷。\n横笛乍随轻吹断，归帆疑与远山齐。\n凤城回望真堪画，万户千门蒋峤西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42251.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42251","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}